flowchart TD
  B[ESP32-S3 boots] --> U[Read immutable hardware UID + persisted device key]
  U --> C[POST /api/nodes/contact<br/>firmware + configurable + LIVE capabilities]
  C --> R{Registered?}

  R -->|no| P[Pending node in FarmPi]
  P --> A[Android Nodes admin approves<br/>assigns logical ID / friendly name / location]
  A --> E[Initial desired configuration<br/>all supported modes OFF]

  R -->|yes| H{Applied fingerprint matches desired?}
  E --> H

  ADM[Android Node Detail<br/>edits OFF / SIMULATED / supported LIVE] --> DC[PUT complete desired config<br/>with expected fingerprint]
  CLI[Pi configure-node-modes helper<br/>administrative alternative] --> DC
  DC --> H

  H -->|yes| S[IN SYNC]
  H -->|no| F[POST /api/nodes/configuration]
  F --> V[Validate schema, identity, capabilities,<br/>canonical bytes + SHA-256]
  V -->|valid| N[Write inactive NVS slot + read back]
  N --> X[Switch active config]
  X --> K[POST /api/nodes/ack]
  K --> S

  V -->|invalid / persistence failure| L[Keep last-known-good config]
  L --> Q[Report failure for attempted fingerprint]
  Q --> D[UPDATE FAILED for current desired state]

  S --> M{Per-measurement mode}
  M -->|SIMULATED| SIM[Generate bounded node-local test value]
  M -->|LIVE + advertised driver| LIVE[Acquire physical value<br/>currently XC4604 soil moisture on GPIO4]
  M -->|OFF| OFF[Send nothing]
  SIM --> I[Authenticated sparse ingest]
  LIVE --> I
  I --> PROV[FarmPi derives per-measurement provenance<br/>from acknowledged configuration]
